on.\n\nPrimary museum records and official cultural sources informed original geometric abstractions; coordinates and artwork were not copied. Human cultural and difficulty review remains open.\n\nThe exact pull-request preflight/build, merged-source validation, lint, formatting, native formatting, syntax, production reproduction/readiness, deterministic build, immutable freeze, whole-artifact inspection, and seven-attachment evidence assembly passed. The repository's temporary fast-release policy waives the long automated shards; they are explicitly not claimed as passing.\n\nSource PR: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/pull/495\nSource: `10190539b243c9edc78eeef9dba174041409aaf2`\nTree: `026404692da6c4a03f2a23fbedbcf015c4df39f2`\nPR gate: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36119910340\nQualification and freeze: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36120411263\nArtifact inspection: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36121300737\nEvidence assembly: https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/actions/runs/36121538254\n\nPublic Pages, browser acceptance, physical touch/controller acceptance, and human cultural/balance review remain separate until completed on the published build.\n"}